  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He spent his entire life’s effort seeking the rumored legendary space cave. In all human history, only he managed to enter and exit it.",
      "chapters": [
        434
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is in a young male body, wearing dirty and tattered clothes, with his chest covered in blue-black wounds.",
      "chapters": [
        1491
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He turns from a young boy to an old man with a wrinkled face and grizzled hair, then turns young once again.",
      "chapters": [
        1511
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "steal-life",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Gu world, rank nine was Venerable. Demon Venerable meant a rank nine demonic path Gu Master, and Immortal Venerable meant a rank nine righteous Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        383
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_righteous_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He was the Venerable after Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable who became the heavenly thief.",
      "chapters": [
        463
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "at-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Lang Ya, Gu Immortals call him a rank nine Gu Immortal when Fang Yuan is presented as his inheritor.",
      "chapters": [
        464
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "at-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_gu_venerable",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Theft path was created by Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable. Formless hand is his signature immortal killer move; outside him, theft path cultivators rarely achieved much.",
      "chapters": [
        946
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_theft"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When he created theft path, he stole the treasures of the world with no one able to forecast or deduce his movements, and rumor tied that to divine concealment and ghostly concealment. In Central Continent, Xu Hao states that research confirmed the qualification for Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable inheritance tests: as long as one is an otherworldly demon, they can easily obtain his inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        949
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "concealment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_xu_hao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His divine concealment and ghostly concealment, born of his space path cultivation, stayed permanently active without ever expending immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        1374
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "concealments-permanence",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At rank six Gu Immortal, he used the immortal killer move familiar face to deceive two rank eight Gu Immortals in a row, gaining large amounts of treasure and, by making the two suspect each other, indirectly causing their deaths.",
      "chapters": [
        975
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "familiar-face",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_familiar_face"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Twenty-one years of failed attempts to refine space escape Gu with Long Hair Ancestor spent both his own savings and Long Hair Ancestor’s treasury, and the ancestor would not take the loss, so Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable had to bring out his own resources to buy immortal materials from him; the unfamiliar face, vaguely familiar face and familiar face set of killer moves was among what he handed over, which is how Lang Ya blessed land came to hold it.",
      "chapters": [
        976
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "familiar-face",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_long_hair_ancestor",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He deceived the two rank eight Gu Immortals only because he had first ensured that neither had investigative methods against it, and the story put others on their guard, so he could never repeat the feat.",
      "chapters": [
        1154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "familiar-face",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Medieval Antiquity Era, three hundred thousand years before the present, Genesis Lotus, Thieving Heaven, and Giant Sun appeared in succession.",
      "chapters": [
        1867
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "era",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_era_medieval"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A late roster of the Ten Venerables places him in the Medieval Antiquity Era alongside Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable and Giant Sun Immortal Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        2085
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-venerables",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A particular inheritance is tied to Luo Po Valley.",
      "chapters": [
        507
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "taking-the-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_luo_po_valley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later takes a Thieving Heaven true inheritance; inside that space, a message gives his real name as Ben Jie Sun, says people in this world call him Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable, and presents him as a vagrant who wants to return home.",
      "chapters": [
        991
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "taking-the-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_thieving_heaven_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaking to Spectral Soul Demon Venerable inside a Thieving Heaven true inheritance space, Thieving Heaven’s will adds that in his original appearance he had blond hair and blue eyes, that he had a fiancee there before coming to this world, and that his high status came from being a mecha operator.",
      "chapters": [
        1015
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "his-account-to-spectral-soul",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "sys_heavens_will"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During Spectral Soul’s grey memory vision, Fang Yuan learns that Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable was an otherworldly demon like himself but not from Earth.",
      "chapters": [
        1020
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ben-jie-sun-not-from-earth",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan clears the heaven’s will that had taken over the dream realm until none remains, keeps a veil that destroys any new invasion, then plans to explore.",
      "chapters": [
        1490
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "the-dream-realm",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "His perspective attaches to young Ben Jie Sun while that youth is still a mortal and has not begun Gu cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        1491
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "young-ben-jie-sun",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the dream desert, after finding a man-made hole under a dried well with a spring and a dried corpse, Fang Yuan wonders whether that is Thieving Heaven’s early fortuitous encounter.",
      "chapters": [
        1492
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "early-fortuitous-encounter",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In his original world, young Thieving Heaven also had a family and healthy parents waiting for him. Tortured by Sha Xiao to make him submit, he tells himself inwardly that he is the great Ben Jie Sun, a noble army general, and holds to that pride until the prospect of leaving those loved ones waiting in vain makes him kneel and yield.",
      "chapters": [
        1494
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "life-before-this-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_sha_xiao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Under Sha Xiao’s coercion, young Thieving Heaven refuses a vicious Gu recipe, saying he has his bottom line.",
      "chapters": [
        1499
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bottom-line",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later makes a third entry into Thieving Heaven’s dream realm.",
      "chapters": [
        1509
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-return",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Thieving Heaven true inheritance whose essence is the killer move steal dao is the basis on which he was able to create theft path. Fang Yuan browses that true inheritance while cooperating with Fang clan.",
      "chapters": [
        1857
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "steal-dao",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_fang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A small world reveals itself with the intense aura of Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable: Thieving Heaven’s space, very likely holding one of his true inheritances.",
      "chapters": [
        2169
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "thieving-heaven-space",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Crazed Demon Cave, Thieving Heaven confronts Limitless Demon Venerable’s will. Limitless had died long ago and only his will was controlling the cave. A huge suit of armor forms around his body and turns him into a metallic giant covered in electric sparks.",
      "chapters": [
        2170
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crazed-demon-cave",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He fights from inside a lightning giant with a mountain-like body. His fingers stab into his hair, and his eyes turn blood red when frenzy takes him.",
      "chapters": [
        2171
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crazed-demon-cave",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
